% Scenario: a page without strokes is unchanged.
% A page that only fills and shows text in a resident font states no
% stroke adjustment, whatever the program set.
true setstrokeadjust
72 600 200 100 rectfill
/Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
72 500 moveto (Filled only) show
showpage
